# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` must NOT upload to Cloud Build.
#
# This file is deliberately explicit rather than relying on gcloud's fallback
# to .gitignore. The fallback would very likely do the right thing here, but
# "very likely" is not the standard for personal data: dataSet/ holds real
# CVs and job listings, redacted_cvs/ holds detected PII values verbatim in
# its pii_spans lists, and artifacts/ embeds extracted CV and listing content
# in every run log. None of that has any business leaving this machine, and a
# build context is not somewhere you can un-send it from.
#
# Anything the image actually needs is COPYed by docker/Dockerfile.api --
# note serving/ is NOT excluded, since the pinned CV is what the deployment
# exists to serve.

# Personal data. Never upload.
dataSet/
redacted_cvs/
artifacts/

# Secrets. Supplied to Cloud Run from Secret Manager, never baked in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local environments and build junk
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# History and tooling
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Large local model exports
docker/ollama/*.gguf
training_data/dataset.jsonl

# Not needed to run the service
tests/
scripts/
PR-*.md
README.md
